{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":3,"title":"요일 이름","desc":"<p>날짜 문자열의 <b>영어 요일 이름</b>(<code>\"Monday\"</code>, <code>\"Tuesday\"</code>, …)을 돌려주는 <code>weekday_name(d)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","solution":"weekday_name <- function(d) {\n  format(as.Date(d), \"%A\")\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>format(날짜, \"%A\")</code> 는 요일 이름이에요. (<code>weekdays()</code> 도 있어요)</p>","tests":[{"call":"weekday_name(\"2024-01-01\")","expected":"Monday","visible":true},{"call":"weekday_name(\"2024-03-01\")","expected":"Friday","visible":true},{"call":"weekday_name(\"2000-01-01\")","expected":"Saturday","visible":false},{"call":"weekday_name(\"2024-12-25\")","expected":"Wednesday","visible":false}],"starter":"weekday_name <- function(d) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-337"}